Those giants who lay claim to being the biggest, longest,

6
00:00:41,820 --> 00:00:46,380
heaviest, and most powerful on Earth.

7
00:00:46,480 --> 00:00:50,120
Supersized monsters that can literally move mountains.

8
00:00:50,220 --> 00:00:53,660
When I say it's beyond imagination,

