00:01:02,901 --> 00:01:05,140
I never knew how big it was.

13
00:01:05,141 --> 00:01:07,800
Miracle machines that can take your breath away.

14
00:01:07,801 --> 00:01:09,880
When we say it's the biggest big screen on the planet,

15
00:01:09,881 --> 00:01:14,320
there's just nothing like it anywhere in the world.

16
00:01:14,321 --> 00:01:16,620
Giants that can do the impossible.

